        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/edgy/mission_fox/scene_fox_contractcreation.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 3d89a72c-c1e8-40d8-8c88-1ffccf308334).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to berlin 47.\r\rToday we got a urgent call from Rolf Hirschmuller. Apparently someone has alerted his drug abuse to the german authorities. Tonight he has to stay att the club Hölle because of the big celebration. Meanwhile he&apos;s scared that the police also are going to be there. Right fully so though because we have spotted five different undercover policemen att the club. This is a protection job so take them out before Rolf gets arrested.\r\rGood luck 47.",
